{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"视线第一下落在左上方金色大字“憋着一股气”，随后落到紧接着的灰白色大字“那点高兴还没退”。两行标题字号大、亮度高，视觉入口明确。正文和右上角蓝色目录明显次一级。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"不确定。大标题没有直接交代人物此刻的具体处境。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"憋闷、憋着一股气，同时还有一点高兴没有消退。能感受到两种情绪并存，但具体关系不够明确。\",\n  \"missed\": \"正文开头“想往前走，脚下却乱了步子”所表达的进退失序，以及右上角“离开后才发现心里空了”的阶段提示。后面关于和弦、节奏和旋律的描述也不容易第一眼获取。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"放大的词本身说不出处境或完整的情绪关系\",\n    \"核心意思分散在两行大标题和较小的正文开头，需要拼接才能理解\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7aabbe69-42b6-4e95-bddf-ccabda82b272", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T022756043394Z", "elapsed_seconds": 26.281, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:28:22.325583+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "bea89d2401d8344be8a69ee314d75a6aef340ce2d338e63f05c2b2d24bc1337c", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\ch